## Known pre-existing drift surfaced (CRM-native, NOT from this batch)

- CrmGlobalSearch (pages/crm/global-search.tsx) filters reference
  crm_customers.phone, crm_leads.email, crm_deals.title,
  crm_quotes.quote_number, crm_products.sku — columns absent from the seeded
  crm_* tables. The header search 500s per collection (page keeps working).
  Same family as the 23 known G1–G3 schema-drift failures; queued for the
  G8 cleanup batch, not introduced here.

